100 years ago today November 18th 1915  Albert Einstein is again preparing to  lecture to the Prussian Academy and his  his mood is ecstatic because a few days  earlier he had used the equations that  he'd been developing for general  relativity to explain a long-standing  puzzle to do the motion of mercury he  had explained why Mercury's orbit shifts  a little bit each year nobody had been  able to do that finally Einstein  succeeds so his frame of mind is  absolutely triumphant but that morning  as he's preparing his lecture he also  opens the mail and in the mail he  receives a paper from David Hilbert and  this paper completely shatters  Einstein's triumphant mood because  remember a few days earlier David  Hilbert had written Einstein a postcard  where he says to Einstein I have figured  general relativity out and come visit  with me and I'll explain the solution to  you of course  Einstein says little busy not feeling so  well I'm not going to come visit you at  all but Einstein is completely rattled  by this and of course by receiving the  paper Hilbert basically said to Hein  Stein I will not take no for an answer  here is my work so Einstein reads the  paper and he sees within it ideas that  he's already been developing so he  immediately writes the hilbert and says  nothing really new here I've already  been down this trajectory you're not  telling me anything I don't already know  but it of course completely shakes  Einstein up as he realizes that Hilbert  is right on his tail toward realizing  the general theory of relativity so  Einstein he gains his composure he gives  his lecture on the motion of mercury and  then he turns to a final push to  complete the  of the general theory of relativity but  you have to bear in mind the context in  Stein's personal life at this moment is  really in chaos his estranged wife  maleva has left Berlin moved back to  Zurich taken the two kids with her I'm  Stein feels that his sons are turning  away from him and on top of that his new  love interest Elsa is also his cousin  she is putting tremendous pressure on  Einstein to finalize a divorce with  maleva  so he's working in Berlin in basically  an empty apartment with all of this  chaos in his personal life around him  and somehow he's able to push through  and as we will see next week come up  with the final form of the equations of  the general theory of relativity
 

